    </bpmndi:BPMNDiagram>
    <bpmn:process id="W_W254" name="W254. Location Master Lifecycle &amp; Hierarchy Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Real estate team confirms a new store/DC opening, relocation, or closure
Frequency: ~10–15 times per year (per the §3.1 growth canon)
Volume: ~1 new store location added/month (10–15/year per the growth canon); hierarchy updates quarterly
Owner: IT ERP Administrator
Participants: Real Estate Manager, VP Store Operations, Finance Controller, Master Data Manager
Source: workflow W254 — Location Master Lifecycle &amp; Hierarchy Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W254_LaneSet6">
        <bpmn:lane id="W254_Lane1" name="VP Store Operations">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W254_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W254_Start7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W254_Lane2" name="Finance Controller">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W254_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W254_Lane3" name="Supply Chain Planner">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W254_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W254_Lane4" name="Master Data Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W254_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W254_Lane5" name="IT ERP Administrator">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W254_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W254_End13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W254_Start7" name="Real estate team confirms a new store/DC opening, relocation, or closure">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W254_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W254_Task8" name="Location Request">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Location Request: Operations submits a Location Master request specifying store type, region, GL company code, and tax registration details (TIN/Branch Code)
Responsible (R): VP Store Operations
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 15 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W254_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W254_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W254_Task9" name="Financial Setup">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Financial Setup: Finance Controller defines the cost center, profit center, and fixed asset location mappings for the new entity
Responsible (R): Finance Controller
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 20 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W254_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W254_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W254_Task10" name="Logistical Setup">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Logistical Setup: Supply Chain assigns the supplying DC, default transit times, and delivery schedules to the location profile
Responsible (R): Supply Chain Planner
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 15 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W254_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W254_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W254_Task11" name="Hierarchy Assignment">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Hierarchy Assignment: Master Data Manager places the location in the enterprise hierarchy (e.g., Region: Visayas → Area: Cebu → Store: Mandaue City)
Responsible (R): Master Data Manager
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 10 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W254_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W254_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W254_Task12" name="System Activation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: System Activation: ERP Administrator activates the location. This triggers automated setup in POS polling routines, replenishment MRP runs, and financial reporting roll-ups
Responsible (R): IT ERP Administrator
Accountable (A): IT ERP Administrator
Duration: 30 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W254_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W254_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W254_End13" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W254_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W254_Annotation14">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-328 (ensure controlled execution — Foundational Masters (PA-29.1).) | - operational: standard operating procedures; system-enforced validation rules
Owner: IT ERP Administrator</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
