    <bpmn:process id="W_W287" name="W287. Vendor Master Data Governance &amp; Deduplication" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Vendor onboarding requests, continuous automated deduplication checks, and manual update requests (e.g., bank detail changes)
Frequency: Continuous deduplication checks; daily vendor changes
Volume: ~10–20 vendor setups/week; ~30–50 updates/week; weekly deduplication script run
Owner: Master Data Manager
Participants: Buyer, AP Clerk, AP Supervisor, Finance Manager, Master Data Analyst
Source: workflow W287 — Vendor Master Data Governance &amp; Deduplication</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W287_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W287_Lane1" name="AP Clerk">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W287_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W287_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W287_Lane2" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W287_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W287_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W287_Lane3" name="Master Data Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W287_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W287_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W287_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W287_End12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W287_Start5" name="Vendor onboarding requests, continuous automated deduplication checks, and manual update…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W287_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W287_Task6" name="Data Entry &amp; Validation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Data Entry &amp; Validation: Vendor data is initially entered during onboarding (W36) or an update is requested. System enforces mandatory fields (TIN, address, bank details) and checks TIN uniqueness to prevent duplicates.
Responsible (R): AP Clerk / Vendor
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 10 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W287_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W287_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W287_Task7" name="Automated Matching">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Automated Matching: System runs nightly matching algorithm across vendor names, addresses, and TINs to flag potential duplicate vendor profiles or parent-child relationships.
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W287_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W287_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W287_Task8" name="Exception Management">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Exception Management: Master Data Analyst reviews flagged potential duplicate vendors. If duplicates are found, analyst investigates (e.g., matching TINs for different branches vs. duplicate creation).
Responsible (R): Master Data Analyst
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 15 min/batch</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W287_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W287_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W287_Task9" name="Merge &amp; Consolidate">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Merge &amp; Consolidate: For confirmed duplicates, analyst executes a merge. System consolidates PO history, payment history, and leaves a tombstone on the deprecated record.
Responsible (R): Master Data Analyst
Accountable (A): Master Data Manager
Duration: 10 min/merge</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W287_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W287_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W287_Task10" name="Audit Trail Logging">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Audit Trail Logging: All changes to critical fields (bank details, TIN, tax classification) are captured in an immutable audit log. Bank detail changes trigger a 48-hour cooling-off period and require secondary approval (W36.7a).
Responsible (R): System / Master Data Analyst
Accountable (A): AP Supervisor
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W287_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W287_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W287_Task11" name="Classification Governance">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Classification Governance: Analyst verifies vendor classification (Local, Import, Service, MSME) using BIR/DTI records to ensure accurate reporting and MSME compliance tracking.
Responsible (R): Master Data Analyst
Accountable (A): Finance Manager
Duration: 5 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W287_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W287_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W287_End12" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W287_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W287_Annotation13">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-328 (ensure controlled execution — Foundational Masters (PA-29.1).) | - operational: Master Data Manager review and approval gate
Owner: Master Data Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W287_Assoc14" sourceRef="W287_Annotation13" targetRef="W287_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
