    <bpmn:process id="W_W292" name="W292. Employee Master Data Governance &amp; Cross-Entity Lifecycle" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: New hire onboarding (W15), cross-entity transfer, position/department change, statutory ID update, or annual data verification
Frequency: Continuous (onboarding ~1,200–1,600 new hires/year per profile §11.4); Quarterly bulk data verification
Volume: ~1,200–1,600 new employee records/year; ~200 cross-entity transfers/year; 6,911 records under governance
Owner: HR Data Steward
Participants: HR Specialist, Payroll Manager, IT ERP Administrator, Department Head
Source: workflow W292 — Employee Master Data Governance &amp; Cross-Entity Lifecycle</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W292_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W292_Lane1" name="HR Specialist">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W292_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W292_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W292_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W292_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W292_Lane2" name="HR Data Steward">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W292_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W292_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W292_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W292_Lane3" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W292_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W292_End13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W292_Start5" name="New hire onboarding (W15), cross-entity transfer, position/department change, statutory…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W292_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W292_Task6" name="Record Creation &amp; Validation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Record Creation &amp; Validation: During onboarding (W15), HR Specialist enters employee master data. System enforces mandatory fields (full name, TIN, SSS, PhilHealth, Pag-IBIG, bank account, BIR tax status). System validates TIN format (XXX-XXX-XXX or XXX-XXX-XXX-XXX), SSS format, and checks for duplicate records using name + birthdate + TIN matching.
Responsible (R): HR Specialist
Accountable (A): HR Data Steward
Duration: 15 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W292_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W292_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W292_Task7" name="Entity Assignment &amp; Position Mapping">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Entity Assignment &amp; Position Mapping: System assigns the employee to the correct legal entity (5 entities). HR Specialist maps to department code, position code, and cost center (linked to W288 Financial Master). System validates that the cost center belongs to the assigned entity.
Responsible (R): HR Specialist
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 5 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W292_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W292_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W292_Task8" name="Statutory ID Verification">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Statutory ID Verification: HR Data Steward verifies that all statutory IDs (TIN, SSS, PhilHealth, Pag-IBIG) are valid and unique. System flags employees with missing or duplicate statutory IDs for remediation before the next payroll run.
Responsible (R): HR Data Steward
Accountable (A): HR Manager
Duration: 10 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W292_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W292_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W292_Task9" name="Cross-Entity Transfer Processing">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Cross-Entity Transfer Processing: When an employee transfers between legal entities (e.g., BuildRight Depot, Inc. → BuildRight Logistics, Inc.), HR Specialist initiates a transfer request. System creates a separation record in the source entity and a new hire record in the target entity, linking them via a cross-reference ID for tenure continuity. Payroll Manager validates that YTD earnings, leave balances, and loan balances transfer correctly.
Responsible (R): HR Specialist / Payroll Manager
Accountable (A): HR Data Steward
Duration: 30 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W292_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W292_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W292_Task10" name="Position &amp; Department Change">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Position &amp; Department Change: Department Head submits a position change request (promotion, lateral move, department reassignment). HR Data Steward updates the employee master, validates the new position code against the organizational hierarchy, and triggers downstream updates (access rights via W152, shift scheduling via W34, reporting line changes).
Responsible (R): HR Data Steward
Accountable (A): HR Manager
Duration: 10 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W292_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W292_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W292_Task11" name="Quarterly Data Verification">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Quarterly Data Verification: System generates a &quot;Data Completeness Report&quot; highlighting employees with missing fields (e.g., missing bank account, expired tax status, incomplete emergency contacts). HR Data Steward distributes reports to department heads for correction.
Responsible (R): HR Data Steward
Accountable (A): HR Manager
Duration: 4 hours/quarter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W292_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W292_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W292_Task12" name="Audit Trail &amp; Change Logging">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Audit Trail &amp; Change Logging: All changes to employee master data (salary, department, entity, statutory IDs) are captured in an immutable audit log with timestamp, old value, new value, and changed-by user.
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W292_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W292_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W292_End13" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W292_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W292_Annotation14">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-54 (prevent unauthorized employee master data changes.) | - operational: standard operating procedures; system-enforced validation rules
Owner: HR Data Steward</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W292_Assoc15" sourceRef="W292_Annotation14" targetRef="W292_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W292_Flow16" sourceRef="W292_Start5" targetRef="W292_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W292_Flow17" sourceRef="W292_Task6" targetRef="W292_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W292_Flow18" sourceRef="W292_Task7" targetRef="W292_Task8" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W292_Flow19" sourceRef="W292_Task8" targetRef="W292_Task9" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W292_Flow20" sourceRef="W292_Task9" targetRef="W292_Task10" />
