    <bpmn:process id="W_W402" name="W402. Contract &amp; Agreement Master Governance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Execution of a new vendor trade agreement, real estate lease, or corporate B2B sales contract
Frequency: ~10–20 new/renewed contracts per week
Volume: ~3,000 active contracts
Owner: Legal Counsel / Contract Administrator
Participants: Category Manager, Procurement Manager, Finance Controller, Master Data Analyst
Source: workflow W402 — Contract &amp; Agreement Master Governance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W402_LaneSet5">
        <bpmn:lane id="W402_Lane1" name="Contract Administrator">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W402_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W402_Start6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W402_Lane2" name="Category Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W402_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W402_Lane3" name="Finance Controller">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W402_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W402_Lane4" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W402_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W402_End11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W402_Start6" name="Execution of a new vendor trade agreement, real estate lease, or corporate B2B sales…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W402_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W402_Task7" name="Contract Ingestion">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Contract Ingestion: Contract Administrator scans and uploads the signed contract into the ERP Contract Management module, capturing metadata (parties, start/end dates, renewal terms, financial value).
Responsible (R): Contract Administrator
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 15 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W402_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W402_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W402_Task8" name="Commercial Terms Mapping">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Commercial Terms Mapping: Category Manager extracts commercial terms (e.g., 2% volume rebate, marketing development funds) and inputs them into the Trade Spend / Rebate agreements master.
Responsible (R): Category Manager
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 20 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W402_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W402_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W402_Task9" name="Lease Accounting Linkage">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Lease Accounting Linkage: For real estate contracts, Finance Controller maps the lease terms (monthly rent, escalation clauses) to the IFRS 16 / PFRS 16 lease accounting module (W275) to generate ROU asset schedules.
Responsible (R): Finance Controller
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 30 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W402_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W402_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W402_Task10" name="Governance &amp; Alerting">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Governance &amp; Alerting: System applies a master rule to send renewal/termination alerts 90 days prior to contract expiration to the respective business owner.
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W402_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W402_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W402_End11" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W402_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W402_Annotation12">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-328 (ensure controlled execution — Foundational Masters (PA-29.1).) | - operational: standard operating procedures; system-enforced validation rules
Owner: Legal Counsel / Contract Administrator</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W402_Assoc13" sourceRef="W402_Annotation12" targetRef="W402_Start6" associationDirection="None" />
