    <bpmn:process id="W_W403" name="W403. Competitor &amp; Market Intelligence Master Governance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Identification of a new market competitor or competitive mapping requirement for price scraping
Frequency: Monthly review
Volume: ~10–15 tracked competitors; ~5,000 mapped KVIs (Key Value Items)
Owner: Pricing Manager
Participants: Merchandising Analyst, Master Data Analyst
Source: workflow W403 — Competitor &amp; Market Intelligence Master Governance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W403_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W403_Lane1" name="Pricing Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W403_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W403_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W403_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W403_Lane2" name="Merchandising Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W403_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W403_Lane3" name="Master Data Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W403_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W403_End10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W403_Start5" name="Identification of a new market competitor or competitive mapping requirement for price…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W403_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W403_Task6" name="Competitor Setup">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Competitor Setup: Pricing Manager defines a new competitor profile, including their store locations (mapped to proximity of BuildRight stores) and ecommerce URLs.
Responsible (R): Pricing Manager
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 20 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W403_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W403_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W403_Task7" name="KVI Mapping">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: KVI Mapping: Merchandising Analyst maps BuildRight SKUs to the exact or comparable competitor SKUs (matching by GTIN, brand, or spec equivalence).
Responsible (R): Merchandising Analyst
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 5 min/SKU</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W403_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W403_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W403_Task8" name="Scraping Configuration">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Scraping Configuration: Master Data Analyst updates the competitive price scraping tool with the new URLs and CSS selectors if necessary.
Responsible (R): Master Data Analyst
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 30 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W403_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W403_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W403_Task9" name="Index Governance">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Index Governance: Pricing Manager reviews the competitive index rules (e.g., &quot;BuildRight price must be &lt;= Competitor X for Category Y&quot;).
Responsible (R): Pricing Manager
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: 15 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W403_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W403_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W403_End10" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W403_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W403_Annotation11">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-328 (ensure controlled execution — Foundational Masters (PA-29.1).) | - operational: Pricing Manager review and approval gate
Owner: Pricing Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W403_Assoc12" sourceRef="W403_Annotation11" targetRef="W403_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
